      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Umbral Plains [ToL]\n**Who:**\n- Binkl Dirkwafer - ToL [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Elemental Ward [item=143016]\n- Netherbian Mind Essence [item=142973]\n- Tegi Fire Essence [item=143023]\n- Tegi Ice Essence [item=142956]\n- Tegi Shadow Essence [item=142951]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Korah Kai the Gardener [ _Quests_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Umbral Plains (10 Points) [quest=10579]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 26 03:15:16 2021\nModified: Fri May 30 05:11:40 2025 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this from Binkl Dirkwater in Umbral Plains. He can be found in the upper northeast corner of the zone in a fireplace. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Binkl Dirkwafer'\nBinkl Dirkwafer says, 'Ey! What're you doin' here! This is my home. Shoo. I'm not going to [relocate] again. You can't make me. Go away!'\nYou say, 'Rest assured, I'm not going to make you relocate.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Get Off My Lawn'.\nBinkl Dirkwafer says, 'You have no proof of this. Go bug my gardener instead. She might give a care about what you have to say. Leave! NOW!'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak to Binkl Dirkwater's \"Gardner\" 0/1 Umbral Plains\nKorah Kai the Gardner is just up the hill from Binkl. Go through her dialogue.\nYou say, 'Hail, Korah Kai the Gardener'\nKorah Kai the Gardener purrs in amusement, throwing a brief gesture in the direction of the chimney. 'I see you met the [old man].'\nYou say, 'Old man? You mean the gnome?'\nKorah Kai the Gardener nods, 'That's the one. His name is Binkl Dirkwafer. He's lived here in the Umbral Plains since before Norrathians rediscovered Luclin.' Her gaze turns towards the chimney again, her expression warm and tender towards the crotchety gnome. 'He won't open up about it, but he's been through a lot. Speaking of...' She turns back towards the adventurer. 'What brings you to the Umbral Plains? Are you here on a [job]?'\nYou say, 'A job? I'm actually here looking for work. Do you need help?'\nKorah Kai the Gardener sighs in relief. 'I really could use your help, actually.' An ear flicks, and her gaze moves back towards Binkl's chimney. 'You need to get his [favor] first to keep hanging around as you are.'\nYou say, 'I'll do what I need to earn his favor.'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Let's set up some magical wards to ease the pressure on the security drone. It will require a few elemental essences to function, but if you can [get them], we can set it up and hopefully he'll be placated enough to let us speak'\nYou say, 'I'll get them. No problem.'\nYour task 'Get Off My Lawn' has been updated.\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Alright!' She jubilantly reaches for the adventurer's journal. 'Here, I'll mark the \"shopping list\" for you. Bring back all four, and we can build the ward from there.'\n2\\. Find a Tegi Fire Essence 0/1 Umbral Plains\n3\\. Find a Tegi Ice Essence 0/1 Umbral Plains\n4\\. Find a Tegi Shadow Essence 0/1 Umbral Plains\n5\\. Find a Netherbian Mind Essence 0/1 Umbral Plains\nThe Essences are pre-lootable. You can get the update by offering them to eg. your familiar.\n> Korah Kai has requested that you gather and return a Tegi Fire Essence, Tegi Ice Essence, Tegi Shadow Essence, and a Netherbian Mind Essence to help her create a magical ward for Binkl Dirkwafer.\n6\\. Bring the Tegi Fire Essence back to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\n7\\. Bring the Tegi Ice Essence back to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\n8\\. Bring the Tegi Shadow Essence back to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\n9\\. Bring the Netherbian Mind Essence back to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\nGive the four Essences to Korah Kai.\nKorah Kai the Gardener hisses as its hot to the touch. 'That'll definitely be the fire essence. I'll, um, get this somewhere before it burns this building down further.'\nKorah Kai the Gardener carefully takes the frozen essence. 'Perfectly cold. You could keep an icebox cold with one of these things for quite a while.'\nKorah Kai the Gardener visibly winces as she takes the shadow essence. 'I can feel the Akhevan corruption in this essence. Thanks.'\nKorah Kai the Gardener is quick to place the mind essence in a bag, shielding it. 'Best not keep this one exposed for long.'\n10\\. Check in with Korah Kai the Gardener 0/1 Umbral Plains\n> With the elemental essences delivered, you will need to check in with Korah Kai for the creation of the ward.\nYou say, 'Hail, Korah Kai the Gardener'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Ah, yes, that's all of them!' She lays each of the four essences in front of her, and begins to murmur a prayer to her ancestors. She thrusts a rod aloft, inviting swirls of color to rise from the essences and infuse themselves within the rod. Within moments the color dissipates and the rod thrums with power. 'There we go.' Handing over the rod, she replies, 'Let me know if you lose the ward, there may be enough power in these essences if you [need another].'\nYou have been given: Elemental Ward [item=143016]\n11\\. Attune the ward to the Eastern side of Brinkl's house 0/1 Umbral Plains\n12\\. Attune the ward to the Southern side of Brinkl's house 0/1 Umbral Plains\n13\\. Attune the ward to the Western side of Brinkl's house 0/1 Umbral Plains\n> Attune the ward to the East, West and South sections of Brinkl's \"property\". The essences should automatically attune to the designated areas.\nJust move around Brink's house, just south of Korah Kai, and the task will update.\n14\\. Return the ward to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\n> With the wards in place, return the Elemental Ward to Korah Kai.\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Thanks so much. I'll hold onto this for later, just in case we'll need to refresh the ward in the future.' She motions over toward the chimney. 'You should go talk to Binkl and see if he's warmed up to you.'\n15\\. Let Binkl Dirkwafer know what you've done for him 0/1 Umbral Plains\n> With the wards in place, test the waters by speaking with Binkl Dirkwafer again.\nYou say, 'Hail, Binkl Dirkwafer'\nBinkl Dirkwafer says, 'You were the one crazy enough to risk yourself for my house? Even though I already have a security system? You're insane. Sure, stay around, but don't overstay your welcome.'\nWhile Binkl Dirkwafer is still of minimal help, at least he won't kick you off his land.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono, Veludeus\n- Gidono",
