      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Umbral Plains [ToL]\n**Who:**\n- Korah Kai the Gardener [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Everfrozen Shard [item=142727]\n- Firefall Portal Fragment [item=143024]\n**Related Quests:**\n- The More They Stay the Same [quest=10691]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 18 19:53:56 2021\nModified: Wed Dec 27 19:42:37 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis quest starts with Korah Kai in Umbral Plains. She can be found via the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Korah Kai the Gardener'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Ah, welcome back. With Binkl a bit less on-edge with your presence, we have a bit of a breather, eh?' She chuckles softly, voice coming with a purred lilt. 'I didn't get an opportunity to introduce myself before. I'm Korah Kai, a shaman of the Dar Khura.' She bows with a flourish. 'As this is one of the safer spots in the area, I negotiated my own presence here with Binkl. His is an unpaid [post], but this patch of land here will be more than sufficient.'\nYou say, 'What post is that?'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Oh, the role as his personal gardener. An hour or so a day of trimming the grass, and I get this nice vantage point to view the [happenings] in this area.'\nYou say, 'What happenings are you concerned about?'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'There's been a political shift in the Umbral Plains. The Akheva, and their shade allies, have cleared out a lot of the ancient Elysian housing, resulting in not only Binkl Dirkwafer's relocation, but the relocation of many of the local denizens of the plains. Speaking of... are you up for some [scouting]?'\nYou say, 'What scouting do you need?'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'I'm looking for an up-to-date status on all of these groups, and it's been a bit since I've been able to step away from the house here. If you're able, check deep into the caves, as well as the gantru camp. Even if Binkl's not the type to pay, I'll do what I can to reimburse you for your troubles. Does that sound [good]?'\nYou say, 'That sounds good to me.'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'Thank you so very much, my adventurer friend. Please let me know what you find.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The More Things Change'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Scout deep into the Netherbian caves 0/1 Umbral Plains\nThis step updates at northernmost room in Netherbian cave - mixed undead and living, so a bard is helpful.\n2\\. Seek evidence of what happened to the frozen caverns 0/1 Umbral Plains\nPick up ground spawn Everfrozen Shard on mound in s/w part of Northernmost room. (/loc +2815, +155). Respawn timer is 100 seconds\n3\\. Scout deep into the eastern fork of the Tegi caves 0/1 Umbral Plains\nThis step updates in easternmost room in Tegi cave.\n4\\. Seek evidence of what happened to the fire portal 0/1 Umbral Plains\nCollect ground spawn Firefall Portal Fragment - lump of mud in southernmost room in pit at center. (/loc -825, -2025)\n5\\. Defeat some Shak Dathor to further investigate the shadow 0/3 Umbral Plains\nKill 3 Shak Dathors.\n6\\. Scout the Gantru camp 0/1 Umbral Plains\nAt the southern part of zone, update is at /loc -1075, -100.\n7\\. Scout the entryway to Vex Thal 0/1 Umbral Plains\n8\\. Defeat some earthen guardians 0/4 Umbral Plains\nKill 4 Stone Guardians. The western one can be single pulled\n9\\. Take the Everfrozen Shard to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\n10\\. Take the Firefall Portal Fragment to Korah Kai 0/1 Umbral Plains\nSpeak with Korah Kai about what you have found.\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'So, most of the northern-most caverns have melted and the two caves are now conjoined? Very interesting...'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'If this is all that's left of the portal, that would mean that the Fyr Jen are now blocked off from Firefall. Was it done willingly?'\n11\\. ??? 0/1 Umbral Plains\nYou say, 'Hail, Korah Kai the Gardener'\nKorah Kai the Gardener says, 'You were right to question whether the Shak Dathor are involved. Although the few you took down didn't shed any further light on the situation, there's signs that the shadow tegi were involved. Whether the Fyr Jen and Syl Ren are aware, I really don't know. Give me a bit longer to look over these samples, and we'll see what next steps to take.'\nThings have changed in the Umbral Plains, and the items you brought will help figure out just how much they have.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
