      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Umbral Plains [ToL]\n**What:**\n- Lost Punch Card [Kill, Kill, Kill]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dirkwafer Home Security Copter [npc=57103]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Umbral Plains (10 Points) [quest=10572]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 18 20:39:35 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nKill shak dathor mobs (could be other mob types as well?) until you get a Lost Punch Card.\nCheck the Lore tab on it to see which quest it contains. Stomp the Herd, Kill Kill Kill, or Protect the Home.\nTarget yourself, then right click on the Lost Punch Card.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Give Dirkwafer Home Security Copter the punch card Kill Kill Kill 0/1 (Umbral Plains)\n2\\. Talk with the Security Copter about the punch card [Kill Kill Kill] 0/1 (Umbral Plains)\nDirkwafer Home Security Copter roams very close around the area where Binkl Dirkwafer and Korah Kai the Gardener are and is available on Find. You can't be invis while talking to him so make sure you Hail him in a safe spot.\n3\\. Eliminate the Netherbians or Shak Dathor 0/11 (Umbral Plains)\n\n---\n\nReward(s): ?\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
